{"id":"B1-L082","title":"Modal deduction (must, might) — introduction","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U05","focus":"Modal deduction (must, might) — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Modal deduction (must, might) — introdução","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["dry knife","pale top","oven heat","baking test","golden crust","cake center","oven door","baking pan","raw dough","ready signal","toothpick test","cooling time","moist crumb","bake sale","fresh batch","cake flavor","chef’s tip","batter bowl"],"field":"Carreira","genre":"Receita e instruções","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 82 · Modal deduction (must, might) — introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Modal deduction (must, might) — introdução.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (carreira).","**Texto do dia:** receita e instruções."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo deduzir fatos do presente com must, might, may, could e can’t numa receita."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["dry knife","faca seca"],["pale top","topo claro"],["oven heat","calor do forno"],["baking test","teste de cozimento"],["golden crust","crosta dourada"],["cake center","centro do bolo"],["oven door","porta do forno"],["baking pan","forma de assar"],["raw dough","massa crua"],["ready signal","sinal de ponto"],["toothpick test","teste do palito"],["cooling time","tempo de resfriamento"],["moist crumb","miolo úmido"],["bake sale","venda de bolos"],["fresh batch","fornada fresca"],["cake flavor","sabor do bolo"],["chef’s tip","dica do chef"],["batter bowl","tigela de massa"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · Instructions","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Is It Ready? Kitchen Signs","paras":["If the kitchen **smells** sweet, the cake **must be** ready. If the knife comes out dry, it **can’t be** raw. If the top is still pale, it **might need** more time; it **could be** the oven is too cold.","Check again in five minutes. It **may be** ready then."],"kicker":"HOW-TO","by":"Home Kitchen","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"A sweet smell means the cake must be ready.","ans":"T","why":"must be ready."},{"q":"A dry knife means the cake is raw.","ans":"F","why":"can’t be raw."},{"q":"A pale top might need more time.","ans":"T","why":"might need more time."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“dry” = ?","opts":["seco","duro","tarde"],"ans":0,"why":"dry."},{"q":"“raw” = ?","opts":["cru","raiva","rato"],"ans":0,"why":"raw."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Dedução com modais","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Modal","Grau de certeza","Exemplo"],"rows":[["must be","~95%","**It must be ready.**"],["may / might / could be","~50%","**It might need more time.**"],["can’t be","~0% (impossível)","**It can’t be raw.**"]],"cap":"Dedução com modais"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**must** = tenho quase certeza; **can’t** = é impossível; **might/may/could** = é possível."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"It ___ be ready. (must)","a":"must","why":"certeza."},{"s":"It ___ be raw. (can’t)","a":"can’t","why":"impossível."},{"s":"It ___ need more time. (might)","a":"might","why":"possibilidade."},{"s":"It ___ be the oven. (could)","a":"could","why":"possibilidade."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["sweet smell","cheiro doce"],["dry knife","faca seca"],["pale top","topo claro"],["oven heat","calor do